WEBVTT

00:00:29.545 --> 00:00:34.103
dhe kur perpjekjet e saj u nderuan ne 2011,

00:00:34.103 --> 00:00:37.543
e ju dha çmimi kombetar i paqes per te rinjte

00:00:37.543 --> 00:00:39.412
e ajo u be shume e famshme

00:00:39.412 --> 00:00:43.456
nje vajze e re shume e famshme 
ne vendin e saj.

00:00:43.456 --> 00:00:46.784
Perpara kesaj, ajo ishte vajza ime,

00:00:46.784 --> 00:00:49.789
por tani une jam babai i saj.

00:00:50.741 --> 00:00:52.496
Zonja e Zoterinj

00:00:52.496 --> 00:00:55.643
nese verejme historine njerezore,

00:00:55.643 --> 00:00:58.471
historia e gruas

00:00:58.471 --> 00:01:01.847
eshte historia e padrejtesise,